   "title": "<div style=\"display:table-cell\">\r\n<h3 style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px\">Question&nbsp;3&nbsp;(2&nbsp;marks)</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding-left:1rem;display:table-cell\"><button class=\"hsc-tooltip nsw-button nsw-button--light\" style=\"padding:0.2rem;min-width:auto;\">Annotations<br />\r\n<span class=\"hsc-tooltiptext\">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;This new item type uses checkboxes allowing more than one response to be selected.<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;It is more difficult to guess the answer in this type of item than in a conventional multiple-choice item.<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;Objective-response items may be worth 1 to 4 marks. </span></button></div>\r\n",
