   "layout": "3",
   "stimulus": "<p>A company uses this spreadsheet to assess the effect of overtime payments on its budget.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0px\">\r\n\t<li style=\"margin-top:0px\">Each employee is paid a base rate of $25 per hour.</li>\r\n\t<li style=\"margin-top:0px\">For each employee, standard hours per week = 30.</li>\r\n\t<li style=\"margin-top:0px\">Different overtime rates are paid to employees based on the hours worked in excess of the standard hours per week.</li>\r\n\t<li style=\"margin-top:0px\">Standard pay = base rate &times; standard hours per week.</li>\r\n\t<li style=\"margin-top:0px\">Weekly pay = standard pay + overtime hours &times; overtime pay rate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
