   "title": "<div style=\"display:table-cell\">\r\n<h3 style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px\">Question 8 (3 marks)</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"display:table-cell;padding-left:1rem\"><button class=\"hsc-tooltip nsw-button nsw-button--light\" style=\"padding:0.2rem;min-width:auto;\">Annotations<br />\r\n<span class=\"hsc-tooltiptext\">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;Responses in the online exam may need to be expressed in different formats such as text, tables, diagrams and SQL.<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;Students may copy text from the question and paste it into their responses.</span></button></div>\r\n",
   "layout": "3",
   "stimulus": "<style type=\"text/css\">.hoa-table-normal {\r\nborder-spacing: 0px;\r\nborder-collapse: collapse;\r\nmargin:10px 0px;\r\n}\r\n\r\ntable thead {\r\nborder-bottom: none;\r\n}\r\n\r\ntable.hoa-table-normal thead tr:first-child th {\r\ntext-align:left;\r\nfont-weight:bold;\r\nborder-collapse: collapse;\r\nborder-right: 1px solid currentColor !important;\r\nborder-left: 1px solid currentColor !important;\r\nborder-top: 1px solid currentColor !important;\r\nbackground-color: rgba(95, 204, 245, 0.3) !important;\r\npadding:3px 6px;\r\ncolor:currentColor;\r\n}\r\n\r\ntable.hoa-table-normal tbody tr:first-child td {\r\nborder: 1px solid currentColor !important;\r\nborder-collapse: collapse;\r\npadding:3px 6px;\r\nbackground-color:transparent !important;\r\ncolor:currentColor;\r\n}\r\n\r\ntable.hoa-table-normal tbody tr td {\r\nborder: 1px solid currentColor !important;\r\nborder-collapse: collapse;\r\npadding:3px 6px;\r\nbackground-color:transparent !important;\r\ncolor:currentColor;\r\n}\r\n</style>\r\n<p>A games store is planning to use a database to keep track of its games, customers and orders. The contents of the Games, Customers and Orders tables during testing are shown.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Games</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"hoa-table-normal\" style=\"margin-top:0em;margin-bottom:1em\">\r\n\t<thead>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th>GameID</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th>GameName</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th>Price</th>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</thead>\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>G001</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Spaghetti Dimension</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>59.99</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>G002</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Quantum Banana</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>49.99</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n \t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>G003</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Turbo Pigeon</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>39.99</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>G004</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Laser Cheese</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>69.99</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Customers</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"hoa-table-normal\" style=\"margin-top:0em;margin-bottom:1em\">\r\n\t<thead>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th>CustID</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th>CustName</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th>CustEmail</th>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</thead>\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>C001</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Nicky Singh</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>N.Singh@nesa.edu.au</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>C002</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Casey He</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>C.He@bos.edu.au</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>C003</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Ash Lee</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>A.Lee@bosnsw.edu</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Orders</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"hoa-table-normal\" style=\"margin-top:0em;margin-bottom:1em\">\r\n\t<thead>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th>OrderID</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th>CustID</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th>GameID</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th>PurchaseDate</th>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</thead>\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>T001</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>C001</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>G001</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>2023-05-15</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>T002</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>C002</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>G004</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>2023-09-25</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>T003</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>C003</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>G002</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>2023-11-10</td>\r\n \t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>T004</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>C003</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>G003</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>2024-01-01</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n",
   "items": [
    {
     "nesaType": 9,
     "code": "ECFAM08Q",
     "question": "<style type=\"text/css\">.hsc-q-1digit {\r\n  text-indent:-1.1rem;\r\nmargin-top:0px;\r\n  margin-left:1.1rem;\r\n  margin-bottom:.6rem;\r\n  font-weight: bold;\r\n}\r\n</style>\r\n<p class=\"hsc-q-1digit\">8&nbsp;&nbsp;&thinsp;Write a SQL query that displays the contents of the Orders table, showing the game name, customer name and purchase date of each game in ascending order of the game name.&nbsp;(3&nbsp;marks)</p>\r\n<code class=\"initial\">CREATE TABLE Games (GameID TEXT, GameName TEXT, Price INT);INSERT INTO Games VALUES (&#39;G001&#39;,&#39;Spaghetti Dimension&#39;,59.99);INSERT INTO Games VALUES (&#39;G002&#39;,&#39;Quantum Banana&#39;,49.99);INSERT INTO Games VALUES (&#39;G003&#39;,&#39;Turbo Pigeon&#39;,39.99);INSERT INTO Games VALUES (&#39;G004&#39;,&#39;Laser Cheese&#39;,69.99);CREATE TABLE Customers (CustID TEXT, CustName TEXT, CustEmail TEXT);INSERT INTO Customers VALUES (&#39;C001&#39;,&#39;Nicky Singh&#39;,&#39;N.Singh@nesa.edu.au&#39;);INSERT INTO Customers VALUES (&#39;C002&#39;,&#39;Casey He&#39;,&#39;C.He@bos.edu.au&#39;);INSERT INTO Customers VALUES (&#39;C003&#39;,&#39;Ash Lee&#39;,&#39;A.Lee@bosnsw.edu&#39;);CREATE TABLE Orders (OrderID TEXT, CustId TEXT, GameId TEXT, PurchaseDate DATE); INSERT INTO Orders VALUES (&#39;T001&#39;,&#39;C001&#39;,&#39;G001&#39;, &#39;2023-05-15&#39;);INSERT INTO Orders VALUES (&#39;T002&#39;,&#39;C002&#39;,&#39;G004&#39;, &#39;2023-09-25&#39;);INSERT INTO Orders VALUES (&#39;T003&#39;,&#39;C003&#39;,&#39;G002&#39;, &#39;2023-11-10&#39;);INSERT INTO Orders VALUES (&#39;T004&#39;,&#39;C003&#39;,&#39;G003&#39;, &#39;2024-01-01&#39;);</code>",
     "options": "{\"word_limit\":45}"
    }
   ]
