   "title": "<h3 style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;margin-right:1rem;display:inline-block\">Question&nbsp;12&nbsp;(8&nbsp;marks)</h3>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"display:inline-block\"><button class=\"hsc-tooltip nsw-button nsw-button--light\" style=\"padding:0.2rem;min-width:auto;\">Annotations<br />\r\n<span class=\"hsc-tooltiptext\">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;Questions may contain parts.<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;Short-answer and objective-response items may share a stimulus.<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;Students may insert special characters and formulae in their responses (part b).<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;The drawing tool allows students to construct a variety of diagrams and charts. Press INFO at the top right corner for the drawing tool user guide and the demonstration video.</span></button></div>\r\n",
   "layout": "3",
